1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,981
Phrasal verbs are learnt with their meaning.

2
00:00:02,981 --> 00:00:04,518
Put up with: tolerate.

3
00:00:04,518 --> 00:00:06,223
Put off: postpone.

4
00:00:06,223 --> 00:00:07,929
Call off: cancel.

5
00:00:07,929 --> 00:00:10,078
Look into: investigate.

6
00:00:10,078 --> 00:00:11,992
Bring up: raise.

7
00:00:11,992 --> 00:00:13,997
Turn down: reject.

8
00:00:13,997 --> 00:00:15,533
Carry out: perform.

9
00:00:15,533 --> 00:00:17,278
Run out of: have none left.

10
00:00:17,278 --> 00:00:22,005
Most can be split: turn the offer down, or turn down the offer.

11
00:00:22,005 --> 00:00:27,148
With a pronoun the split is compulsory: turn it down, never turn down it.

12
00:00:27,148 --> 00:00:31,679
And verbs with two particles, like put up with, are never split.

